OL,3,GNEWSARoad restrictions for NCP car park
OL,4,Ademolition
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic restrictions will be in force
OL,7,Ffrom Monday as part of the demolition
OL,8,Fof a multi-storey car park in
OL,9,FNottingham.
OL,11,FVehicles travelling in both directions
OL,12,Fwill use the northbound side of Maid
OL,13,FMarian Way.
OL,15,FThe restrictions are part of the
OL,16,Fdemolition of the former NCP car park
OL,17,Fand the wider redevelopment of the
OL,18,FBroad Marsh area of the city.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
