OL,3,GNEWSARoad restrictions for NCP car park
OL,4,Ademolition
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomes England, the government's housing
OL,7,Fand regeneration agency, bought the
OL,8,Fsite last year with plans to turn it
OL,9,Finto about 1,000 homes, alongside up to
OL,10,F20,000 sq m (215,000 sq ft) of retail,
OL,11,Foffice and community space.
